    "lgx-home-seo": {
      "type": "home-seo-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_q1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is LEGXI?",
            "answer": "<p>LEGXI is India's leading authenticated sports memorabilia brand. We offer officially signed and verified collectibles from cricket and football stars, each issued with a Certificate of Authenticity and backed by our digital verification portal at legxi.co\/pages\/authentication.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does LEGXI verify the authenticity of its products?",
            "answer": "<p>Every LEGXI collectible is obtained through managed signing sessions with direct athlete oversight. Each item is issued a unique Certificate of Authenticity (COA) with a code you can verify anytime through the LEGXI Authentication Portal. The COA documents the athlete, event, signing date, and edition number.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What sports memorabilia does LEGXI offer?",
            "answer": "<p>LEGXI offers signed cricket memorabilia (balls, jerseys, framed artwork), officially licensed Argentine Football Association (AFA) collectibles, bespoke limited-edition art pieces, and numbered-edition limited-run cricket posters — all hand-signed and authenticated.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do all LEGXI products come with a Certificate of Authenticity?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Every product sold through LEGXI includes a tamper-proof Certificate of Authenticity documenting the athlete, event, signing date, and unique edition number. Physical and digital verification through the LEGXI portal are both supported.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does LEGXI ship across India?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. LEGXI ships to all major cities and states across India with full insurance coverage on every order. All collectibles are packaged securely to preserve their condition and value during transit.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_q6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I transfer ownership of a LEGXI collectible?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. LEGXI's Ownership Transfer System allows verified transfer of ownership registration for any collectible, maintaining an unbroken chain of custody and preserving the full provenance record — protecting the long-term value of your purchase.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_q1",
        "faq_q2",
        "faq_q3",
        "faq_q4",
        "faq_q5",
        "faq_q6"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#1c1c1c",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "heading": "India's Premier Destination for Authenticated Sports Memorabilia",
        "body_content": "<p>LEGXI was founded on a singular conviction: that the rarest moments in sport deserve to live beyond the field. We are India's most trusted marketplace for officially authenticated sports memorabilia — connecting passionate collectors with <a href=\"\/collections\/hand-signed-products\">hand-signed, limited-edition collectibles<\/a> that carry the verified signature of some of the greatest athletes alive.<\/p><p>Our collection spans the two sports that India holds closest to its heart: <a href=\"\/collections\/cricket-signed-collectibles\">cricket<\/a> and football. From Arshdeep Singh's hand-signed championship ball to officially licensed <a href=\"\/collections\/afa-signed-collectibles\">Argentine Football Association (AFA)<\/a> pieces bearing the signatures of World Cup legends, every LEGXI product is the result of a carefully managed signing session conducted under strict chain-of-custody protocols.<\/p><p>Every collectible sold through LEGXI is issued a tamper-proof Certificate of Authenticity (COA). Each COA includes unique identification details — athlete, event, signing date, and edition number — so you always know exactly what you own. LEGXI's digital <a href=\"\/pages\/authentication\">Authentication Portal<\/a> lets you verify the provenance of any collectible anytime using the unique code on your certificate.<\/p><p>LEGXI ships across India with full insurance on every order. Whether you are building a personal gallery or gifting something truly extraordinary, LEGXI brings you the closest possible connection to sporting greatness.<\/p>",
        "faq_heading": "Frequently Asked Questions"
      }
    },
